Who we are

VIRTHIO is a technology consulting company that provides services and solutions to support both national and international clients across various sectors, such as Banking, Services, Energy, among others. We drive our clients' businesses forward through a dedicated team and ensure the allocation of highly qualified and specialized IT talent for projects in a wide range of areas, tailored to the specific needs and reality of each organization. We have IT experts working in areas as diverse as IT Consulting, Nearshore, Turnkey Projects, Blockchain, and Machine Learning.
What you will be doing

Translate business and technical requirements into scalable and robust architectures;
Work closely with development teams, Product and other stakeholders throughout the solution lifecycle;
Define and support cloud-based and distributed architectures;
Contribute to integration, containerization and automation initiatives;
Drive the adoption of CI/CD and Infrastructure as Code practices;
Ensure that architectural decisions take security, scalability and regulatory requirements into account;
Support the continuous improvement of the overall technology landscape.

What you will need to succeed

Minimum of 7 years of experience in Software Engineering and/or Solution Architecture;;
Previous experience in Banking, Financial Services, Payments or another regulated environment is a strong advantage;
Strong hands-on experience with .NET and SQL Server;
Solid knowledge of Microsoft Azure and cloud-native solutions;
Experience with distributed systems, APIs/integration and container-based environments;
Familiarity with Azure DevOps and CI/CD pipelines;
Experience with Terraform, Bicep or other Infrastructure as Code technologies;
Good awareness of security and compliance within enterprise environments;
Strong communication skills and the ability to interact with both technical and business stakeholders;
Fluent English, both written and spoken.

What the company will offer you

Challenging environment with modern technologies and cloud architectures;
Career development and continuous learning opportunities;
Collaborative and dynamic working environment;
Flexible and hybrid working model;

Next Steps

If you are interested in this opportunity, we would appreciate it if you could share your updated CV with us - bernardo.miranda@virth.io
. Alternatively, if you're looking for new professional challenges, feel free to get in touch — we'll be happy to talk about other career opportunities with you.

